<#ff78c8>HOPE GAUGE</>
  The pink bar at the bottom of the screen starts every round
  empty. Her hits fill it (+3 per normal, +5 per special,
  +1 when blocked). It holds two stocks of 50.
Hope		^X
  Spends 50 Hope (cancels from normals on contact). She glows
  pink and her next arrow special is powered up. The glow
  lasts until she uses one or gets hit.
  Hope Arrow: always the full 5-arrow volley, homing in on
  the opponent's height.
  Hope Squall: the rain falls right away, twice the arrows,
  and they home in.
  Hope Shaft: two extra arrows in the follow-up volley, all
  homing.

<#ff78c8>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Magia Cancel (1 bar, on hit or block)		^B_+^C
  Cancels into neutral, or a dash with _F. Once per combo.
Guard Cancel (1 bar, while blocking)		^B_+^C
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
Air Jump / Air Dash		_U / _F_F

<#ff78c8>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chains: Light into Medium into Heavy, standing into
  crouching.
Command Normals		_F^A / _F^B / _F^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Skyna Peach (air)		_F^C

<#ff78c8>SPECIALS</>
  C is the strongest version.
Magical Arrow (ground/air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Long recovery on the ground.
Blast Squall		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  The rain stops if she is hit. God's Message keeps falling.
Lunatic Shaft		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff78c8>SUPERS</>
Rapid Fire Arrow (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
God's Message (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C. Blesses her with slow regeneration.
Raging Star (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^B
Torus Ascension (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Command grab: Ultimate Madoka cinematic.
